		{"id":"201f40c9fef9ef78","type":"text","text":"通过两个解法对比可发现，求数列的通项公式关键在于抓住递推公式的特点，构造出辅助数列，选取角度的不同也会导致运算复杂程度的差异.","x":-55,"y":-3820,"width":685,"height":217},
		{"id":"c40aa3bb3e0a6521","type":"text","text":"$\\lambda a_{n + 1} - \\mu a_n = d(\\lambda \\neq \\mu)$","x":-861,"y":-4198,"width":360,"height":58},
		{"id":"fe7cfde0a22284db","type":"text","text":"（2021浙江卷10改编）已知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_1 = 1, a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} (n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*)$ 。记数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$ ，求证： $2 < S_{100} < 3$\n分析 一方面, 首先通过角度3和角度4,  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} \\rightarrow \\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 - \\frac{1}{4} \\rightarrow \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n+1}}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{1}{2}$  (放缩), 累加可得  $a_n$  的下限表达式, 再求  $S_n$  的下限范围; 另一方面, 由角度1、角度2、角度4得  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} \\rightarrow \\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} < \\frac{n+1}{n+3}$ , 由累乘法求出  $a_n < f(n)$ , 数列  $\\{a_n\\}$  求和, 经裂项相消证明出另一半结论.\n### 解析\n![](d61c24b86692a26e837799106537e96cab86865fffec0903297cac73bd23b9cb.jpg)\n① 证明  $S_{100} > 2$\n由  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}}$  可得  $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}}{a_n} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}}\\right)^2 + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 - \\frac{1}{4}$ , 则  $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} < \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2$ , 所以  $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n+1}}} < \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}$ , 即  $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n+1}}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{1}{2}$ , 则  $\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n-1}}}\\right) + \\dots + \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_2}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_1}}\\right) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_1}} < \\frac{n-1}{2}$ .\n又因为  $a_1 = 1$ ，所以  $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{n + 1}{2}$ ， $\\sqrt{a_n} > \\frac{2}{n + 1}$ ，即  $a_n > \\frac{4}{(n + 1)^2} (n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^+)$ ，则  $a_n > \\frac{4}{(n + 1)^2} > \\frac{4}{(n + 1)(n + 2)} = 4\\left(\\frac{1}{n + 1} - \\frac{1}{n + 2}\\right)$ .\n故  $S_{100} = a_1 + a_2 + \\dots +a_{100} > 1 + 4\\left(\\frac{1}{3} -\\frac{1}{4} +\\frac{1}{4} -\\frac{1}{5} +\\dots +\\frac{1}{101} -\\frac{1}{102}\\right) = 1 + 4\\left(\\frac{1}{3} -\\frac{1}{102}\\right) =$ $1 + \\frac{22}{17} >2.$\n② 证明  $S_{100} < 3$\n解法一：  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\frac{2}{n + 1}} = \\frac{n + 1}{n + 3} a_n$  ，即  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} < \\frac{n+1}{n+3}$  所以  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} \\cdot \\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{a_2}{a_1} < \\frac{n+1}{n+3} \\cdot \\frac{n}{n+2} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{2}{4}$ ，即  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_1} < \\frac{6}{(n+3)(n+2)} = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{n+2} - \\frac{1}{n+3}\\right)$ .\n又因为  $a_1 = 1$ ，所以  $a_{n+1} < 6\\left(\\frac{1}{n+2} - \\frac{1}{n+3}\\right)$ ， $a_n < 6\\left(\\frac{1}{n+1} - \\frac{1}{n+2}\\right)$ ，则  $S_n = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{4} + \\dots + \\frac{1}{101} - \\frac{1}{102}\\right) = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{102}\\right) = 3 - \\frac{2}{34} < 3.$\n综上所述，  $2 <   S_{100} <   3$\n解法二：由  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}}$  得  $\\frac{a_{n + 1}}{a_n} = \\frac{1}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} < 1$ ，则数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  单调递减，且  $a_{n + 1} + \\sqrt{a_n} a_{n + 1} - a_n = 0$ ，即  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n - a_{n + 1}}{\\sqrt{a_n}} = \\frac{2(a_n - a_{n + 1})}{2\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{2(a_n - a_{n + 1})}{\\sqrt{a_n} + \\sqrt{a_{n + 1}}} = 2(\\sqrt{a_n} - \\sqrt{a_{n + 1}})$ ，则  $a_{n + 1} < 2(\\sqrt{a_n} - \\sqrt{a_{n + 1}})$ ，因此  $S_{100} = a_1 + a_2 + \\dots + a_{100} < 1 + 2(\\sqrt{a_1} - \\sqrt{a_2} + \\sqrt{a_2} - \\sqrt{a_3} + \\dots + \\sqrt{a_{99}} - \\sqrt{a_{100}}) = 1 + 2(\\sqrt{a_1} - \\sqrt{a_{100}}) = 3 - 2\\sqrt{a_{100}} < 3.$\n综上所述，  $2 <   S_{100} <   3$","x":-115,"y":-4280,"width":706,"height":160},
		{"id":"ae9d834906f6f373","type":"text","text":"$a_{n+1} - a_{n} = 2^{n} (n \\in \\mathbb{N}^{*}), a_{1} = 1$ ","x":-1164,"y":-4287,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8370b3c825bd71d0","type":"text","text":"$a_{n + 1} - a_n = \\frac{1}{n(n + 1)} (n \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$","x":-1494,"y":-4140,"width":381,"height":60},
		{"id":"9d91c924c7cdd065","type":"text","text":"在数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 中，已知 $a_1 = 1$\n(1) 若 $n a_{n+1} - (n+1) a_n = 1$ ，求 $a_n$ .  \n(2) 若 $n a_{n+1} - (n+2) a_n = 1$ ，求 $a_n$ .","x":630,"y":-4384,"width":617,"height":127},
		{"id":"4339b45d30b26e96","type":"text","text":"设数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 满足 $a_{1} = 1, a_{2} = 2$，且对于其中任意三个连续项 $a_{n-1}, a_{n}, a_{n+1}$，都有 $a_{n} = \\frac{(n-1)a_{n-1} + (n+1)a_{n+1}}{2n}$，则通项 $a_{n}$ = \n分析思路一：由已知条件可得  $2na_{n} = (n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}$  ，观察发现  $a_{n - 1},a_{n + 1}$  的系数和与  $a_{n}$  相等，所以可将  $2na_{n}$  拆为  $(n - 1)a_{n}$  和  $(n + 1)a_{n}$  ，从而与  $a_{n - 1},a_{n + 1}$  配对，将原递推公式转化为  $\\frac{a_{n + 1} - a_n}{a_n - a_{n - 1}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n + 1}$  ，进而可将  $a_{n + 1} - a_n$  视为一个整体，设为  $b_{n}$  （角度2的形式），则符合累乘的特点.累乘后可得  $a_{n + 1} - a_n = \\frac{2}{n(n + 1)}$  （角度1的形式），再进行累加即可得到通项公式.\n思路二：本题还可以从递推公式中的“同构入手”，构造辅助数列， $a_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2n} \\Rightarrow na_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2}$ ，此三项具备同构特点，故设  $b_{n} = na_{n}$  则递推公式变为  $b_{n} = \\frac{b_{n + 1} + b_{n - 1}}{2}$ ，所以  $\\{b_n\\}$  为等差数列，其公差可由  $b_{1}, b_{2}$  计算，从而得到  $\\{b_n\\}$  的通项公式以求得  $a_{n}$ 。\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span>  $\\triangleright$  解法一（累乘法与累加法）：从结构出发  $2n = (n - 1) + (n + 1)$ ，因此  $2na_{n} = [(n - 1) + (n + 1)]a_{n} = (n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}$ ，即  $(n - 1)(a_n - a_{n - 1}) = (n + 1)(a_{n + 1} - a_n)(n\\geqslant 2,n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ ，即  $\\frac{a_{n + 1} - a_n}{a_n - a_{n - 1}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n + 1}$ .\n从而  $\\frac{a_3 - a_2}{a_2 - a_1} = \\frac{1}{3}, \\frac{a_4 - a_3}{a_3 - a_2} = \\frac{2}{4}, \\frac{a_5 - a_4}{a_4 - a_3} = \\frac{3}{5}, \\dots, \\frac{a_n - a_{n-1}}{a_{n-1} - a_{n-2}} = \\frac{n-2}{n}$ ，累乘得  $\\frac{a_n - a_{n-1}}{a_2 - a_1} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{2}{4} \\times \\frac{3}{5} \\times \\dots \\times \\frac{n-2}{n} = \\frac{1 \\times 2}{n(n-1)}$ .\n又  $a_2 - a_1 = 1$  ，所以  $a_{n} - a_{n - 1} = \\frac{2}{n(n - 1)} = 2\\left(\\frac{1}{n - 1} -\\frac{1}{n}\\right).$\n因此  $a_{n} = (a_{n} - a_{n - 1}) + (a_{n - 1} - a_{n - 2}) + \\dots +(a_{2} - a_{1}) + a_{1}$\n$\\begin{array}{l} = 2 \\left(\\frac {1}{n - 1} - \\frac {1}{n} + \\frac {1}{n - 2} - \\frac {1}{n - 1} + \\dots + \\frac {1}{1} - \\frac {1}{2}\\right) + 1 \\\\ = 2 \\left(1 - \\frac {1}{n}\\right) + 1 = 3 - \\frac {2}{n} (n \\in \\mathbf {N} ^ {*}). \\\\ \\end{array}$\n解法二（同构辅助数列）：由  $a_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2n}$  得  $na_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2}$ ，因此数列  $\\{na_{n}\\}$  是等差数列，设公差为  $d$ ，则  $d = 2a_{2} - a_{1} = 3$ ，所以  $na_{n} = 1 \\times a_{1} + 3(n - 1) = 3n - 2 (n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$ ，可得  $a_{n} = 3 - \\frac{2}{n} (n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$ .","x":330,"y":-3573,"width":600,"height":264},
		{"id":"bf83d6b8ca034396","type":"text","text":"（2012新课标全国卷理16）数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_{n + 1} + (-1)^n a_n = 2n - 1$  ，则  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前60项和为\n分析 若  $a_{n+1}$  与  $a_n$  的关系式含有  $(-1)^n$ , 一般需分奇偶项讨论: 当  $n = 2k - 1$  和  $n = 2k$  时, 分别得到“等差型”和“等和型”的递推式, 以下分奇数项之和与偶数项之和分别求解. 解题时涉及两个角度: 角度  $1: d \\rightarrow 2n - 1$ ; 角度  $2: -\\rightarrow (-1)^n$ .\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 当  $n = 2k - 1$  时， $a_{2k} - a_{2k - 1} = 2(2k - 1) - 1 = 4k - 3 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ ；当  $n = 2k$  时， $a_{2k + 1} + a_{2k} = 4k - 1 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ .\n两式相减可得  $a_{2k + 1} + a_{2k - 1} = (4k - 1) - (4k - 3) = 2$  ，即相邻的奇数项之和为2.\n前60项中所有奇数项之和为  $(a_{1} + a_{3}) + (a_{5} + a_{7}) + \\dots +(a_{57} + a_{59}) = 2\\times 15 = 30$  ，又因为\n$\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} a _ {2} - a _ {1} = 1 \\\\ a _ {4} - a _ {3} = 5 \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ a _ {6 0} - a _ {5 9} = 4 \\times 3 0 - 3 = 1 1 7 \\end{array} , \\text {所 以} (a _ {2} - a _ {1}) + (a _ {4} - a _ {3}) + \\dots + (a _ {6 0} - a _ {5 9}) = 1 \\times 3 0 + \\frac {3 0 \\times (3 0 - 1)}{2} \\times \\right.$\n$4 = 1770$  ，则  $S_{60} = (a_2 - a_1) + (a_4 - a_3) + \\dots +(a_{60} - a_{59}) + 2\\times [(a_1 + a_3) + \\dots +(a_{57} + a_{59})]$ $1770 + 60 = 1830.$\n故  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前60项和为1830.\n\n变式（1）（2020新课标全国I卷文16)若数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_{n + 2} + (-1)^n a_n = 3n - 1, S_{16} = 540$  ，则  $a_1 = \\_$\n分析  $\\triangleright$  角度  $1: d \\rightarrow 3n - 1$ ; 角度  $2: -\\rightarrow (-1)^{n}$ .\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 当  $n = 2k$  时， $a_{2k + 2} + a_{2k} = 3 \\times 2k - 1 = 6k - 1 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ ；当  $n = 2k - 1$  时， $a_{2k + 1} - a_{2k - 1} = 3 \\times (2k - 1) - 1 = 6k - 4 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ .\n又  $a_2 + a_4 + \\dots + a_{16} = (6 \\times 1 - 1) + (6 \\times 3 - 1) + (6 \\times 5 - 1) + (6 \\times 7 - 1) = 6 \\times (1 + 3 + 5 +7)  -4 = 92$  ，则  $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} a_{3} - a_{1} = 6 \\times 1 - 4 = 2 \\\\ a_{5} - a_{3} = 6 \\times 2 - 4 = 8 \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ a_{2k + 1} - a_{2k - 1} = 6k - 4 \\end{array} \\right.$ ，求和可得  $a_{2k + 1} - a_1 = \\frac{(2 + 6k - 4)k}{2} = 3k^2 - k$ ，所以  $a_{2k + 1} = a_1 + 3k^2 - k$ 。\n则  $a_1 + a_3 + \\dots + a_{15} = 8a_1 + 3(1^2 + 2^2 + \\dots + 7^2) - (1 + 2 + \\dots + 7)$\n$\\begin{array}{l} = 8 a _ {1} + 3 \\times \\frac {7 \\times (7 + 1) \\times (2 \\times 7 + 1)}{6} - \\frac {(1 + 7) \\times 7}{2} \\\\ = 8 a _ {1} + 3 9 2. \\\\ \\end{array}$\n所以  $S_{16} = 92 + 8a_{1} + 392 = 540$  ，解得  $a_1 = 7$","x":-55,"y":-3573,"width":250,"height":264},
		{"id":"b19fdb6dad79de83","type":"text","text":"$\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} = d, \\{a_n\\}$ ","x":-1439,"y":-3458,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0afdc4e6d3516bf0","type":"text","text":"[[高中数学逻辑结构/知识点/没有用的小知识-蛛网模型]]","x":-3233,"y":-3520,"width":218,"height":93},
		{"id":"b331fbff0eb87b6c","type":"text","text":"$a_{n+1} - a_n = n (n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*)$","x":-1428,"y":-4371,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cbdfab7c921a604e","type":"text","text":"$a_{n+1} - a_n = d$","x":-1429,"y":-4431,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ccf602844fd16822","type":"text","text":"已知在数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  中， $a_{1} = 1, a_{2} = \\frac{1}{4}$ ，且  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{(n-1)a_{n}}{n-a_{n}} (n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$ ，求数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的通项公式。\n分析  $\\gg$  整理  $a_{n+1}$  和  $a_n$  的关系式，得到一个角度 1 中所阐述的“等差型”的递推关系式  $\\frac{1}{na_{n+1}} - \\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} = -\\frac{1}{n(n-1)}$ ，其中“等差  $f(n)$ ”是  $-\\frac{1}{n(n-1)}$ ，需裂项求和，通过累加法抵消中间各项得  $\\{a_n\\}$  的通项公式.\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span>  $\\triangleright$  由  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{(n-1)a_n}{n-a_n}$  得  $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{n}{(n-1)a_n} - \\frac{1}{n-1}$ , 即  $\\frac{1}{na_{n+1}} = \\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} - \\frac{1}{n(n-1)} (n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ , 则  $\\frac{1}{na_{n+1}} - \\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} = -\\frac{1}{n(n-1)} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{n-1} - \\frac{1}{n}\\right)$ , 所以  $\\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} - \\frac{1}{(n-2)a_{n-1}} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{n-2} - \\frac{1}{n-1}\\right)$ ,  $\\dots, \\frac{1}{3a_4} - \\frac{1}{2a_3} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{3}\\right)$ .\n叠加得  $\\frac{1}{(n - 1)a_n} -\\frac{1}{2a_3} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{2} -\\frac{1}{n - 1}\\right) = \\frac{1}{n - 1} -\\frac{1}{2}$  又  $a_{3} = \\frac{a_{2}}{2 - a_{2}} = \\frac{1}{7}$  可得  $\\frac{1}{(n - 1)a_n} = \\frac{1}{n - 1} +$ $3 = \\frac{3n - 2}{n - 1}$  所以  $a_{n} = \\frac{1}{3n - 2} (n\\geqslant 3,n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$  ，又  $a_1 = 1,a_2 = \\frac{1}{4}$  也满足此式，因此  $a_{n} = \\frac{1}{3n - 2} (n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$","x":-115,"y":-4440,"width":706,"height":120},
		{"id":"02ef63b3060da0db","type":"text","text":"等比中项","x":-1405,"y":-4620,"width":185,"height":60},
		{"id":"19d173b7e03046bf","type":"text","text":"$a_{n} = (a_{n} - a_{n-1}) + (a_{n-1} - a_{n-2}) + \\dots + (a_{2} - a_{1}) + a_{1}$","x":-893,"y":-4408,"width":639,"height":67},
		{"id":"e4f7a36432807349","type":"text","text":"已知等比数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 的公比 $q > 1$ ，且 $a_{3} + a_{4} + a_{5} = 28, a_{4} + 2$ 是 $a_{3}, a_{5}$ 的等差中项。数列 $\\{b_{n}\\}$ 满足 $b_{1} = 1$ ，数列 $\\{(b_{n+1} - b_{n})a_{n}\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和为 $2n^{2} + n$ .\n(1)求 $q$ 的值.  \n(2)求数列 $\\{b_n\\}$ 的通项公式","x":2209,"y":-4697,"width":598,"height":157},
		{"id":"6e25f73800e00680","type":"text","text":"已知  $b > 0$  且  $b \\neq 1$ ,如果数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是等差数列,那么数列  $\\{b^{a_{n}}\\}$  是否一定是等比数列?如果数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是各项均为正的等比数列,那么数列  $\\{\\log_{b}a_{n}\\}$  是否一定是等差数列?","x":30,"y":-4864,"width":507,"height":274},
