		{"id":"c2834fe9a1a391eb","type":"text","text":"等比数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的公比  $q\\neq - 1$  ,前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$ ","x":784,"y":-4816,"width":291,"height":146},
		{"id":"d5ac45cc85505e38","type":"text","text":"$f(x) = \\frac{a_{1}}{q} \\cdot q^{n}(x \\in \\mathbf{R})$ ","x":-1405,"y":-4804,"width":320,"height":68},
		{"id":"b3b5df709d414ed2","type":"text","text":"$S_{n}$  ,  $S_{2n} - S_{n}$  ,  $S_{3n} - S_{2n}$  成等比数列,公比为  $q^{n}$","x":1146,"y":-4865,"width":506,"height":99},
		{"id":"6a356edcd029f34b","type":"text","text":"$a_{n} = a_{m}q^{n - m}$","x":-752,"y":-4864,"width":207,"height":60},
		{"id":"bfc9c8f889d0a3b3","type":"text","text":"指数函数","x":-949,"y":-4801,"width":184,"height":60},
		{"id":"a2df16f4553e2844","type":"text","text":"(2023全国甲卷)记  $S_{n}$  为数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和,已知  $a_{2} = 1,2S_{n} = n a_{n}.$\n(1)求  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的通项公式;\n(2)求数列  $\\left\\{{\\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}}}\\right\\}$  的前  $n$  项和  $T_{n}$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> (1)当  $n = 1$  时,  $2S_{1} = a_{1}$  ,即  $2a_{1} = a_{1}$  ,所\n以  $a_{1} = 0$\n当  $n\\geqslant 2$  时,由  $2S_{n} = n a_{n}$  ,得  $2S_{n - 1} = (n - 1)a_{n - 1}$\n两式相减得  $2a_{n} = n a_{n} - (n - 1)a_{n - 1},$   即  $(n - 1)a_{n - 1} = (n - 2)a_{n}$  当  $n = 2$  时,可得  $a_{1} = 0$  故当  $n\\geqslant 3$  时  $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n - 2}$  则  $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}}\\cdot \\frac{a_{n - 1}}{a_{n - 2}}\\cdot \\dots$ $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}} = f(n)$  可式,采用累乘凑求通项  $\\frac{a_{3}}{a_{2}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n - 2}\\cdot \\frac{n - 2}{n - 3}\\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{2}{1}$  整理得  $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{2}} = n - 1$  因为  $a_{2} = 1$  ,所以  $a_{n} = n - 1(n\\geqslant 3)$\n当  $n = 1, n = 2$  时, 均满足上式, 所以  $a_{n} = n - 1$ .\n注意检验\n(2)令  $b_{n} = \\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}} = \\frac{n}{2^{n}}$ ,\n$\\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}} = \\frac{n}{2^{n}}$  是等差数列  $\\times$  等比数列的形式, 故采用错位\n相减法求和\n则  $T_{n} = b_{1} + b_{2} + \\dots +b_{n - 1} + b_{n} = \\frac{1}{2} +\\frac{2}{2^{2}} +\\dots +\\frac{n - 1}{2^{n + 1}} +\\frac{n}{2^{n}}.$ $①$\n$\\frac{1}{2} T_{n} = \\frac{1}{2^{2}} +\\frac{2}{2^{3}} +\\dots +\\frac{n - 1}{2^{n}} +\\frac{n}{2^{n + 1}}, ②$\n错位\n由  $① - ②$  得  $\\frac{1}{2} T_{n} = \\frac{1}{2} +\\frac{1}{2^{2}} +\\frac{1}{2^{3}} +\\dots +\\frac{1}{2^{n}} - \\frac{n}{2^{n + 1}} =$\n$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}(1 - \\frac{1}{2^{n}})}{1 - \\frac{1}{2}} - \\frac{n}{2^{n + 1}} = 1 - \\frac{2 + n}{2^{n + 1}},$\n即  $T_{n} = 2 - \\frac{2 + n}{2^{n}}$ .\n检验: 设  $b_{n} = \\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}} = \\frac{n}{2^{n}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{2} n + 0\\right) \\times \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n - 1}$ , 故\n$\\begin{array}{l}{{A=\\frac{a}{q-1}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}-1}=-1,B=\\frac{b-A}{q-1}=\\frac{0+1}{\\frac{1}{2}-1}=-2,}}\\\\ {{T_{n}=\\left(-n-2\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}+2=2-\\frac{2+n}{2^{n}}.}}\\end{array}$\n2023\n事实上, 能用错位相减法求和的试题也可以通过待定系数法转化为裂项相消法求和, 原理:  $a_{n} = f(n + 1) - f(n)$ , 则  $S_{n} = a_{1} + a_{2} + \\dots +a_{n - 1} + a_{n} = f(2) - f(1) + f(3) - f(2) + \\dots +f(n) - f(n - 1) + f(n + 1) - f(n) = f(n + 1) - f(1)$ , 对于差比数列来说, 这里的  $f(n) = c_{n} = (an + b)q^{n}$ .\n另解  $b_{n} = n \\cdot 2^{- n} = \\left[a(n + 1) + b\\right] \\cdot 2^{- n - 1} - (an + b) \\cdot 2^{- n} = \\left(- \\frac{1}{2} an + \\frac{1}{2} a - \\frac{1}{2} b\\right) \\cdot 2^{- n}$ , 对比系数可得  $- \\frac{1}{2} a = 1, \\frac{1}{2} a - \\frac{1}{2} b = 0$ , 解得  $a = - 2, b = - 2$ , 则  $T_{n} = f(n + 1) - f(1) = \\left[- 2(n + 1) - 2\\right] \\cdot 2^{- n - 1} - \\left(- 2 - 2\\right) \\times 2^{- 1} = 2 - \\frac{n + 2}{2^{n}}$ .","x":2187,"y":-4932,"width":599,"height":189},
		{"id":"36b95d910f369efb","type":"text","text":"$S_{n} = \\frac{a_{1}(1 - q^{n})}{1 - q} (q \\neq 1)$","x":150,"y":-5003,"width":285,"height":60},
		{"id":"18a299259b981631","type":"text","text":"$S_{n} = \\frac{a_{1} - a_{n}q}{1 - q} (q \\neq 1)$","x":537,"y":-5003,"width":278,"height":60},
