		{"id":"8209034ed541d56b","type":"text","text":"已知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$  若  $a_{n + 3} = a_{n} + 1$  ,且  $a_{1} = 1,a_{2} = 2,a_{3} = 3$  ,则  $S_{90} =$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 由  $a_{n + 3} = a_{n} + 1$  ,可知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是个\"类周期数列\".因此可设数列  $\\{b_{n}\\}$  满足  $b_{n} = a_{3n - 2}+$ $a_{3n - 1} + a_{3n}$  ,则  $b_{n + 1} = a_{3n + 1} + a_{3n + 2} + a_{3n + 3} = a_{3n - 2}+$\n$1 + a_{3n - 1} + 1 + a_{3n} + 1 = b_{n} + 3$  ,于是数列  $\\{b_{n}\\}$  是公差为3的等差数列,且  $b_{1} = a_{1} + a_{2} + a_{3} = 6$  ,于是得到  $S_{90} = (a_{1} + a_{2} + a_{3}) + (a_{4} + a_{5} + a_{6}) + \\dots +$ $(a_{88} + a_{89} + a_{90}) = b_{1} + b_{2} + \\dots +b_{30} = 30\\times 6+$ $\\frac{30\\times 29}{2}\\times 3 = 1485.$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">答案</span> 1485","x":2578,"y":-5700,"width":532,"height":340},
		{"id":"bd8069cf851b91e6","type":"text","text":"等差数列$S_{n}$图像","x":567,"y":-5311,"width":274,"height":60},
