		{"id":"8cfba7260b1dd0a5","type":"text","text":"若数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 满足 $a_1 = 2, a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + a_n}$ ，则 $a_{2022} = (\\quad)$ .","x":-1446,"y":-6134,"width":433,"height":95},
		{"id":"6a50535b55ae92fe","type":"text","text":"$a_{n} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll} S_{1} & n = 1 \\\\ S_{n} - S_{n - 1} & n \\geqslant 2 \\end{array} \\right.$","x":-106,"y":-6161,"width":350,"height":95},
